    <!-- FAQ Q&A - Updated names to match HelpSupportActivity.kt -->
    <string name="faq_q1">How to register on Rozgar Connector?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Click \'Register\' on the login screen, enter your name, CNIC, phone number, and upload documents. You must wait for Admin approval to use the app.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">Why is my account status still \'Pending\'?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Admin team manually verifies your CNIC and documents for safety. This process usually takes 12–24 hours.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">Is my CNIC data safe?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">Yes, your CNIC and personal documents are encrypted and only used for identity verification by the Admin team.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">How to update my portfolio?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Go to the \'Profile\' tab. Educated workers can update degrees, while skilled workers can update experience and project photos.</string>

    <string name="faq_q5">How do I post a new job?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">As a Seeker, go to Home and click the \'+\' button. Choose between Professional (Educated) or Manual (Skilled) work types.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">How can I see who applied for my job?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Go to the \'Activities\' tab and select \'Worker Apps\'. You will see a list of workers who applied for your post.</string>
    <string name="faq_q7">How do I hire a specific worker?</string>
    <string name="faq_a7">Find a worker on the Home screen, view their profile, and click \'Hire This Worker\' to send a direct offer.</string>
    <string name="faq_q8">Can I edit my job post?</string>
    <string name="faq_a8">Yes, go to \'Activities\' -> \'My Posted\' and click the \'EDIT\' button on any open job card.</string>

    <string name="faq_q9">How do I find available jobs?</string>
    <string name="faq_a9">As a Provider, your Home screen automatically shows jobs matching your type (Professional or Manual). Use filters to narrow down results.</string>
    <string name="faq_q10">How many jobs can I apply for?</string>
    <string name="faq_a10">There is no limit! You can apply for any job that matches your skills and district.</string>
    <string name="faq_q11">How do I know if I am hired?</string>
    <string name="faq_a11">You will receive a notification in the \'Activities\' tab. Once accepted, the job moves to your \'Active\' contracts tab.</string>
    <string name="faq_q12">What is the difference between Educated and Skilled?</string>
    <string name="faq_a12">Educated workers provide professional services like IT or Teaching. Skilled workers provide manual services like Plumbing or Driving.</string>

    <string name="faq_q13">What is the SOS button?</string>
    <string name="faq_a13">The SOS button is an emergency feature. Clicking it during an active job will immediately dial 15 (Police) for your safety.</string>
    <string name="faq_q14">How are workers verified?</string>
    <string name="faq_a14">Every worker must upload their CNIC and documents. Admin manually verifies these against the national database.</string>
    <string name="faq_q15">How to report a fake user?</string>
    <string name="faq_a15">You can report any user by contacting our support team via email from the Help &amp; Support screen.</string>
    <string name="faq_q16">Is my location shared?</string>
    <string name="faq_a16">Your general district is visible to all, but your exact work address is only shared with the person you are in a contract with.</string>

    <string name="faq_q17">How do I mark a job as finished?</string>
    <string name="faq_a17">Once work is done, go to the active job in the \'Activities\' tab and click \'FINISH JOB\'. Both parties must confirm completion.</string>
    <string name="faq_q18">How do payments work?</string>
    <string name="faq_a18">Currently, payments are handled directly between the seeker and worker (Cash or Bank). RozgarConnector does not collect payments yet.</string>
    <string name="faq_q19">Why should I rate the other person?</string>
    <string name="faq_a19">Ratings help build trust. High-rated workers get more jobs, and good seekers attract the best talent.</string>
    <string name="faq_q20">Can I cancel a contract?</string>
    <string name="faq_a20">Yes, but only before work has started. Frequent cancellations can lower your trust rating.</string>

